042.xtpl:1: 'Count' is the name of one of xtpl's verbs: a call to count() is the runtime's u_xtpl_count, never a function of the file. Give it another name.
042.xtpl:3: 'first' is the name of one of xtpl's verbs: a call to first() is the runtime's u_xtpl_first, never a function of the file. Give it another name.
042.xtpl:5: 'join' is the name of one of xtpl's verbs: a call to join() is the runtime's u_xtpl_join, never a function of the file. Give it another name.
